<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Mar industrial production up 9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Mar industrial production up 9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's industrial production index rose 9.0 percent year-on-year in March, the Statistics Department said.</p>
<p>On a month-on-month basis, the index was up 2.7 percent.</p>
<p>The index is a measure of the rate of change in the production of industrial commodities over time.</p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION INDEX</p>
<p> March 1997    - 145.4</p>
<p> February 1997 - 141.6</p>
<p> March 1996    - 133.4</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
